murun: embedded-file and name-tree helpers on PDFs without /Names

PDFObject.get() returns JS null for a missing key; the helpers, ported
from the wasm library (which returns a Null object), called methods on
it. getEmbeddedFiles, insertEmbeddedFile, deleteEmbeddedFile and
loadNameTree threw on a PDF without /Names, and _loadNameTreeRec called
an undefined loadNameTreeRec for any tree with /Kids.
---
diff --git a/source/tools/murun.c b/source/tools/murun.c
index c57d6e1e6..ec57783dd 100644
